{
  "title": "Annex A field names, spelled as the schema spells them",
  "source": {
    "document": "ECMA-430",
    "clause": "Annex A (informative), JSON Schema for NLIP Messages",
    "note": "composed: the field names are Annex A's own spelling (MessageType, Format, Subformat, Content, Submessages, Label); the values are composed to exercise §5 \"Capitalization is not relevant to the name or value of the field\"."
